# Runtime types

Full map: `src/runtime/types/README.md`.

- `tv.ts` holds `ThemeConfig`, `ComponentConfig`, and `SlotClasses`. Components type `ui` with `SlotClasses`.
- `index.ts` only re-exports interfaces from the non-setup script block of each SFC.
- Do not import build-time `src/utils` here.
- Do not re-export this folder from `src/module.ts`.
